message_text = "A lucky day in the 3rd moon of [color=red]17xx[/color]

My lady,

I hear your music through the screen each night. It sounds like a world I’m not allowed to touch.

But tonight I wrote your name in the dust of the storeroom shelves, just once, before sweeping it away.

The thought of you gives me courage to dream of what might be possible.

– Kouya"

